WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.462
How long do you think you're going to live? 
60, 70, 80 years?

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:13.394
Okay, we'll give you a hundred,
but don't be fooled because many people die 
way younger than that.

00:00:13.405 --> 00:00:18.860
But let's say, your cut off date 
or death date is 100 years, then what?

00:00:18.871 --> 00:00:23.120
Have you prepared or thought about 
what's to come next?

00:00:23.131 --> 00:00:26.929
Now, what's my purpose
or goal in telling you this?

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:35.528
Well, it's to inspire you, to think deeper 
into the reality of this short,
fleeting transitory life.

00:00:35.539 --> 00:00:43.209
How many of us have seen friends
or family members, that you loved
or some that you even hated,

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:47.246
but now they're gone. You've lost them.

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:53.738
Doesn't this rattle something inside of you 
to think deeper into where they go?

00:00:53.749 --> 00:01:01.085
We were just arguing, joking, laughing together,
but now they're no more.

00:01:01.096 --> 00:01:05.902
We somehow think that we are going 
to live forever in this life,

00:01:05.913 --> 00:01:12.519
as if science is going to develop a pill 
that will extend our lives forever.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.608
For those of us, who have been living 
for some time,

00:01:15.619 --> 00:01:21.685
if you just look at  the process of age,
something very obvious,

00:01:21.696 --> 00:01:28.486
when you just look at some of the old pictures 
of when you were young,

00:01:28.497 --> 00:01:36.698
but now we're becoming older, 
we were once full of strength, 
but now we are going in reverse

00:01:36.709 --> 00:01:39.124
and becoming older and weak.

00:01:39.135 --> 00:01:48.178
You get into a routine, for many of us 
it stays the same – wake up, work, work out, 
hang out, sleep.

00:01:48.189 --> 00:01:55.580
Some eagerly awake the weekends, 
just to be able to make it to the bars 
or the nightclubs.

00:01:55.591 --> 00:02:02.241
Where men lust over women 
like an animal on the hunt for his prey

00:02:02.252 --> 00:02:11.026
and sadly women go to these places 
putting themselves on display
and becoming some horny dog's prey.

00:02:11.037 --> 00:02:20.101
Waking up the next day with a nasty hangover,
feeling guilty and doing the walk of shame.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:29.171
And then, just to do the same thing 
the next weekend, but this time 
you might have an STD.

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:38.287
Is this what life is about? 
Fulfilling one's desires at the expense 
of losing one's soul?

00:02:38.298 --> 00:02:47.144
Now, your intuition tells you 
this can't just be it – Baby Mama Drama,
sports, party, play entertainment,

00:02:47.155 --> 00:02:51.181
alcohol, drugs, chasing all the material things.

00:02:51.192 --> 00:02:56.962
There has to be more to this life,
than all of these superficial things.

00:02:56.973 --> 00:03:06.391
An ultimate goal, a true purpose 
to your existence to why am I here on this earth

00:03:06.402 --> 00:03:09.524
and where am I going when i die.

00:03:10.488 --> 00:03:18.588
You see, my goal was to motivate you to reflect,
ponder and think to the reality of this life.

00:03:18.599 --> 00:03:26.352
The reality of death and the common sense 
question that all of us should be asking.

00:03:26.363 --> 00:03:31.313
What is the purpose of my life? 
Why am I here?

00:03:31.324 --> 00:03:34.080
Now, it's up to you to do something about it.

00:03:34.091 --> 00:03:35.577
Thank you for listening.

00:03:35.588 --> 00:03:39.909
Subscribe if you haven't already 
to the Deen Show.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.515
Peace be with you.

